# Manuscript project (wongo)

This folder is a journal manuscript written in Quarto and rendered to Word by
wongo (https://github.com/hoohugokim/wongo). The `.qmd` files are the source
of truth; the Word files in `output/` are disposable renders.

## Commands

- `wongo status` — where the manuscript stands and the suggested next step
- `wongo check` — word limit, citations, cross-references, figures
- `wongo render --target collab` — Word files for coauthors (Track Changes on)
- `wongo render --target submission` — refused while a HARD check fails
- `wongo roundtrip <coauthor.docx>` — coauthor edits into `decisions/merge-*.md`
- `wongo review <worksheet>` (a person) or `wongo worksheet set` (an agent) —
  decide each edit; `wongo worksheet lint <worksheet>` must pass before any
  approved edit is applied to the `.qmd`
- `wongo profile show <journal>` — the journal's verified requirements
- `wongo doctor` — Quarto, R and this project's configuration

Add `--json` to any command for machine-readable output.

## Rules

- One sentence per line in `.qmd` prose.
- Numbers from analysis are inline code (`` `r ...` ``), never typed by hand.
- Cite with `@citekey` from `refs.bib`; cross-reference with `@fig-`, `@tbl-`, `@sec-`.
- wongo never edits the `.qmd` from a worksheet. Apply only rows the author
  approved, and only after `wongo worksheet lint` passes.
- Journal requirements come from `wongo profile show <journal>`; never guess them.
